<title>UK: SBC sets call warrants on German bank basket.</title>
<headline>SBC sets call warrants on German bank basket.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Schweizerischer Bankverein (Deutschland) AG has issued a total of two million American-style call warrants, in two equal tranches, on a basket of German bank shares, lead manager SBC Warburg said.</p>
<p>Each basket consists of shares of Commerzbank AG, Dresdner Bank AG and Deutsche Bank AG.</p>
<p> EXERCISE PERIOD 29.JAN.97-19.DEC.97   PAYDATE	28.JAN.97</p>
<p> LISTING	   FFT/DUES		  MIN EXER LOT 100</p>
<p> SPOT REFERENCE  3,259.15 DEM</p>
<p>* * * *</p>
<p> WARRANT	STRIKE	ISSUE     PREMIUM     GEARING</p>
<p> CALL A	 3,000 DEM   3.66 DEM  3.3 PCT     8.9 TIMES</p>
<p> CALL B	 3,300 DEM   2.00 DEM  7.4 PCT    16.3 TIMES</p>
<p>--Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
